  "question": {
    "html": "<p>Two aluminium cubes, A and B, are brought into contact with each other. The side length of cube A is 5 cm and its temperature is 10 <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"^{o}\"></span>C. The side length of cube B is 10 cm and its temperature is 190 <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"^{o}\"></span>C. Energy transfer only takes place between the blocks. </p>\n<p>What is the final temperature of the two blocks?</p>\n<p></p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\">\n<li data-label=\"A\">100 <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"^{o}\"></span>C</li>\n<li data-label=\"B\">130 <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"^{o}\"></span>C</li>\n<li data-label=\"C\">154 <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"^{o}\"></span>C</li>\n<li data-label=\"D\">170 <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"^{o}\"></span>C</li>\n</ol>"
  },
